q.com","name":"KoWming"},"message":"feat 更新 随机图床API v2.3.0\n\n🚀 架构升级：移除独立 HTTP 服务和端口配置，随机图片、预览与统计 API 由当前插件直接提供\\n🌐 访问简化：无需端口映射，自动复用 MoviePilot 当前域名、HTTPS 和反向代理配置\\n🧹 升级兼容：首次加载自动关闭旧版登记的独立服务并释放历史端口，旧配置中的 port 字段自动忽略\\n⚡ 稳定性提升：彻底消除端口占用、服务线程、延迟启动任务及热更新抢占问题\\n🎨 界面适配：配置页移除端口输入，状态页和仪表盘统一展示同源 API 可用状态\\n💝 感谢由@qsxazcv 提交的 v3 兼容性修复方法","tree":{"sha":"0798b745baa90c9dccb0336ff0b885cd2526674a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xijin285/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/0798b745baa90c9dccb0336ff0b885cd2526674a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xijin285/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/0f0c45843da7cecff208df0e32b34b4d511440a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96684377?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoWming/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoWming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoWming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoWming/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KoWming","id":96684377,"login":"KoWming","node_id":"U_kgDOBcNJWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoWming/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoWming/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoWming/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoWming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoWming/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoWming","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xijin285/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/0f0c45843da7cecff208df0e32b34b4d511440a3","node_id":"C_kwDOOq9GUNoAKDBmMGM0NTg0M2RhN2NlY2ZmMjA4ZGYwZTMyYjM0YjRkNTExNDQwYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xijin285/MoviePilot-Plugins/commit/1e36ca37607c9cdfc528033dbe4a848756dafc42","sha":"1e36ca37607c9cdfc528033dbe4a848