//api.github.com/users/Cammisuli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cammisuli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cammisuli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cammisuli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cammisuli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whitej031788/jamie-nx/commits/81ecb22abe3e81dcdc77951a5c54fd5112903df8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-14T19:58:30Z","email":"4332460+Cammisuli@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jonathan Cammisuli"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-14T19:58:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(core): add nx console messaging to TUI (#31148)\n\n<!-- Please make sure you have read the submission guidelines before\nposting an PR -->\n<!--\nhttps://github.com/nrwl/nx/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#-submitting-a-pr\n-->\n\n<!-- Please make sure that your commit message follows our format -->\n<!-- Example: `fix(nx): must begin with lowercase` -->\n\n<!-- If this is a particularly complex change or feature addition, you\ncan request a dedicated Nx release for this pull request branch. Mention\nsomeone from the Nx team or the `@nrwl/nx-pipelines-reviewers` and they\nwill confirm if the PR warrants its own release for testing purposes,\nand generate it for you if appropriate. -->\n\n## Current Behavior\n<!-- This is the behavior we have today -->\nThere is no communication between Nx CLI and Nx Console\n\n## Expected Behavior\n<!-- This is the behavior we should expect with the changes in this PR\n-->\nThis enables a connection between the Nx TUI app and Nx Console so that\nwe can send messages to console. This is used to update MCP tools on Nx\nConsole to assist with LLMs\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n<!-- Please link the issue being fixed so it gets closed when this is\nmerged. -->\n\nFixes #","tree":{"sha":"f6e5b2c3c8b554c699c49cb369fb3a1d74321858","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whitej031788/jamie-nx/git/trees/f6e5b2c3c8b554c699c49cb369fb3a1d74321858"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whitej031788/jamie-nx/git/commits/81ecb22abe3e81dcdc77951a5c54fd5112903df8","verification":{"payload":"tree f6e5b2c3c8b554c699c49cb369fb3a1d74321858\nparent 47b9b51dd3b08a0d397ead5e582a53d31b71446c\nauthor Jonathan Cammisuli <4332460+Cammisuli@users.noreply.github.com> 1747252710 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1747252710 -0400\n\nfeat(core): add nx console messaging to TUI (#31148)\n\n<!-- Please make sure you have read the submission guidelines before\nposting an PR -->\n<!--\nhttps://github.com/nrwl/nx/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#-submitting-a-pr\n-->\n\n<!-- Please make sure that your commit message follows our format -->\n<!-- Example: `fix(nx): must begin with lowercase` -->\n\n<!-- If this is a particularly complex change or feature addition, you\ncan request a dedicated Nx release for this pull request branch. Mention\nsomeone from the Nx team or the `@nrwl/nx-pipelines-reviewers` and they\nwill confirm if the PR warrants its own release for testing purposes,\nand generate it for you if appropriate. -->\n\n## Current Behavior\n<!-- This is the behavior we have today -->\nThere is no communication between Nx CLI and Nx Console\n\n## Expected Behavior\n<!-- This is the behavior we should expect with the changes in this PR\n-->\nThis enables a connection between the Nx TUI app and Nx Console so that\nwe can send messages to console. This is used to update MCP tools on Nx\nConsole to assist with LLMs\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n<!-- Please link the issue being fixed so it gets closed when this is\nmerged. -->\n\nFixes #","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoJPXmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANngQABY66duRiTGQhi2I1JY8TWe5\nRboSorR5v3x3u1QDNblLnde8ti7NNg7ZiGdZ4p7lpAJHTetfWki62TtvsoGRl0m2\n3z80e9U9VcfDwtfxkf7kpfrKJAM+f09H21itj/0JxddmZpcTp2/IM3XmCt9FVpK+\nwUbnE3Nd6QEZQuTv