9117cfc0e945e4ec3d4e477bced1ab1e67"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6372535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hendrickson-tyler/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hendrickson-tyler/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hendrickson-tyler/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hendrickson-tyler/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hendrickson-tyler","id":6372535,"login":"hendrickson-tyler","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzI1MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hendrickson-tyler/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hendrickson-tyler/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hendrickson-tyler/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hendrickson-tyler/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hendrickson-tyler/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hendrickson-tyler","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whitej031788/jamie-nx/commits/21bdb35a078d1e73c78fd35e6a98921c67aee779/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-14T16:00:34Z","email":"6372535+hendrickson-tyler@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tyler Hendrickson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-14T16:00:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(esbuild): update peerDep range (#30402)\n\n## Current Behavior\n`esbuild` has a [security\nadvisory](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-67mh-4wv8-2f99) for\nversions older than 0.25.0. `@nx/esbuild` does not allow versions\ngreater than 0.19.2 due to the range specified in peer dependencies.\n\nA fix for this was attempted in #30167, but it still does not allow any\nversions greater than 0.19.x due to the way [0.x.x releases are\nhandled](https://github.com/npm/node-semver#caret-ranges-123-025-004).\n\n## Expected Behavior\n`@nx/esbuild` allows any version from the current 0.19.2 onwards, not\nincluding a future 1.x.x version. This will allow non-vulnerable\nversions of `esbuild` to be used.\n\n## Related Issue(s)\nFixes #30009 \nFixes #30370","tree":{"sha":"ec7b56c2e9b031427bf2f0f9d5953082ff6dcb75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whitej031788/jamie-nx/git/trees/ec7b56c2e9b031427bf2f0f9d5953082ff6dcb75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whitej031788/jamie-nx/git/commits/21bdb35a078d1e73c78fd35e6a98921c67aee779","verification":{"payload":"tree ec7b56c2e9b031427bf2f0f9d5953082ff6dcb75\nparent cc22a0760113b10a0c6a67249c25f9651693e73f\nauthor Tyler Hendrickson <6372535+hendrickson-tyler@users.noreply.github.com> 1747238434 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1747238434 +0000\n\nfix(esbuild): update peerDep range (#30402)\n\n## Current Behavior\n`esbuild` has a [security\nadvisory](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-67mh-4wv8-2f99) for\nversions older than 0.25.0. `@nx/esbuild` does not allow versions\ngreater than 0.19.2 due to the range specified in peer dependencies.\n\nA fix for this was attempted in #30167, but it still does not allow any\nversions greater than 0.19.x due to the way [0.x.x releases are\nhandled](https://github.com/npm/node-semver#caret-ranges-123-025-004).\n\n## Expected Behavior\n`@nx/esbuild` allows any version from the current 0.19.2 onwards, not\nincluding a future 1.x.x version. This will allow non-vulnerable\nversions of `esbuild` to be used.\n\n## Related Issue(s)\nFixes #30009 \nFixes #30370","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoJL4jCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0GgQADtJhrBJ4w22RQsZaPdQeOe9\ns6JdWmGktw+a/+kXjUN0ob9/EwKVPFp1BgMBy2bCW9mIJF8ByDnq+SvAwXD75NPi\nwRMGt/yZGBhK6uEkclGA9qW98AqjmS481fNzmj8CnWz0nBUjry5M3XINKySfmCMs\nS9nfJ7WGA1bcTQWoJImTCcZYy3hbA7F9yv4htHQXSWlxHCWrsyCcNYrB0KyZw9LI\nckrq0SlM/j3xI/PQuf5cRd33jmGxH605oC9Ef08J0e5FOgy9zk0BK9XaxQ+6MTTJ\nK0+NJ+Vm5i9l/14OKN4skc7gUeBbJ5ilTPMi6BWNnanFKfHOe5QZaDB6fA4EUA4Z