:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(angular): install `@angular/build` when using vitest test runner (#31169)\n\n## Current Behavior\n\nThe application and library generators do not install the\n`@angular/build` package when using the `vitest` test runner. This can\ncause resolution issues depending on the package manager because the\npackage is a peer dependency of the `@analogjs/vite-plugin-angular`\npackage.\n\n## Expected Behavior\n\nThe application and library generators should install the\n`@angular/build` package when using the `vitest` test runner.\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n\nFixes #30646","tree":{"sha":"7e1db60282e9803145e80712f57a826ee80f4889","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whitej031788/jamie-nx/git/trees/7e1db60282e9803145e80712f57a826ee80f4889"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whitej031788/jamie-nx/git/commits/e1c0be3d2dd889c64930dffe0cf1d69c7443bfcf","verification":{"payload":"tree 7e1db60282e9803145e80712f57a826ee80f4889\nparent 8cf4b551745cc9c8e5025ca5dd2f8e226b16c847\nauthor Leosvel Pérez Espinosa <leosvel.perez.espinosa@gmail.com> 1747135369 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1747135369 +0200\n\nfix(angular): install `@angular/build` when using vitest test runner (#31169)\n\n## Current Behavior\n\nThe application and library generators do not install the\n`@angular/build` package when using the `vitest` test runner. This can\ncause resolution issues depending on the package manager because the\npackage is a peer dependency of the `@analogjs/vite-plugin-angular`\npackage.\n\n## Expected Behavior\n\nThe application and library generators should install the\n`@angular/build` package when using the `vitest` test runner.\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n\nFixes #30646","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoIyuJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHS4QACXjQWBPfIlmEAjbD3qC1WS6\nJNISEDoQrKMxMB1U707uk0Mx9kD+KkLgLNRaI/n/6iabIThuEu0H84TEfoZf09kr\n6ZBhwI9reFK7HJb9/lYzujmEU0pXTk4Vfj9GGAO0BfqS9iUCKuDJirRz