","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whitej031788/jamie-nx/commits/ce1d6b2e6ee3e3acba52acc11c034de6eb1fcac1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-09T23:59:10Z","email":"4332460+Cammisuli@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jonathan Cammisuli"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-09T23:59:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(core): change default native logging to \"OFF\" (#31161)\n\n<!-- Please make sure you have read the submission guidelines before\nposting an PR -->\n<!--\nhttps://github.com/nrwl/nx/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#-submitting-a-pr\n-->\n\n<!-- Please make sure that your commit message follows our format -->\n<!-- Example: `fix(nx): must begin with lowercase` -->\n\n<!-- If this is a particularly complex change or feature addition, you\ncan request a dedicated Nx release for this pull request branch. Mention\nsomeone from the Nx team or the `@nrwl/nx-pipelines-reviewers` and they\nwill confirm if the PR warrants its own release for testing purposes,\nand generate it for you if appropriate. -->\n\n## Current Behavior\n<!-- This is the behavior we have today -->\n\"ERROR\" is set as the default logging level when using native logging.\nThis causes issues with the new function of calling the native logger\nfrom the JS side.\n\n## Expected Behavior\n<!-- This is the behavior we should expect with the changes in this PR\n-->\n\"OFF\" is set as the default so that no logs appear on stdout if there\nwas no explicit opt-in.\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n<!-- Please link the issue being fixed so it gets closed when this is\nmerged. -->\n\nFixes #","tree":{"sha":"395ffba5b65ef77f3030cdc66ab007f00e0280cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whitej031788/jamie-nx/git/trees/395ffba5b65ef77f3030cdc66ab007f00e0280cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whitej031788/jamie-nx/git/commits/ce1d6b2e6ee3e3acba52acc11c034de6eb1fcac1","verification":{"payload":"tree 395ffba5b65ef77f3030cdc66ab007f00e0280cd\nparent bf1eec5ecab80f1a2aa2d7839b50b89d36be4f62\nauthor Jonathan Cammisuli <4332460+Cammisuli@users.noreply.github.com> 1746835150 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1746835150 +0000\n\nfix(core): change default native logging to \"OFF\" (#31161)\n\n<!-- Please make sure you have read the submission guidelines before\nposting an PR -->\n<!--\nhttps://github.com/nrwl/nx/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#-submitting-a-pr\n-->\n\n<!-- Please make sure that your commit message follows our format -->\n<!-- Example: `fix(nx): must begin with lowercase` -->\n\n<!-- If this is a particularly complex change or feature addition, you\ncan request a dedicated Nx release for this pull request branch. Mention\nsomeone from the Nx team or the `@nrwl/nx-pipelines-reviewers` and they\nwill confirm if the PR warrants its own release for testing purposes,\nand generate it for you if appropriate. -->\n\n## Current Behavior\n<!-- This is the behavior we have today -->\n\"ERROR\" is set as the default logging level when using native logging.\nThis causes issues with the new function of calling the native logger\nfrom the JS side.\n\n## Expected Behavior\n<!-- This is the behavior we should expect with the changes in this PR\n-->\n\"OFF\" is set as the default so that no logs appear on stdout if there\nwas no explicit opt-in.\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n<!-- Please link the issue being fixed so it gets closed when this is\nmerged. -->\n\nFixes #","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoHpbOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUUEQAAvZsxBnjuDd1eGbbn6oWeTN\nGSsWhOjNOMFix6GI65gfsgpvi6JxkJKTC7zNic85ouHevm6V7AuH0dyQmEkNVWl8\nQ7Rk9inAvqEKMdmQ1rwBbuTJFZy1G3k3Cw1e46nqd4lB4anEAnugm9Lt+oNiLC2X\nnfz7HBhanpSMB7O81CwIcaKr86ygJmhvyEg1fJwMLOXHTP52C+dg7Nzcappcg5HQ\n4c6wo4cX1YtIMGHBe4coEksWoNSD1QGMnuMwRhem5zi8+R/Hmk6H3BSYSOsSc3p+\nmCRHC23o3IJzCUmJO0fiAlOWIT2ca5Cj4Wi6/ENLPEEH+iCuALOCA71nhXn5/PJC\nnLyCSZryp68UBVjhiMB9fo6nWv4vnyIZcWT6yuPEtQD4YHdEuxqjhXvBsEyBhfWM\nfKbscPFWVZzF0P7q