ocused, but the tasks\nlist is visible and the task is not interactive\n\n## Expected Behavior\nWhen running a single task, the tui is minimal without a tasks list and\nwith interactivity by default\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n<!-- Please link the issue being fixed so it gets closed when this is\nmerged. -->\n\nFixes #","tree":{"sha":"8ff70593fbcbea9e06c153a76e9b339d063aa29f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whitej031788/jamie-nx/git/trees/8ff70593fbcbea9e06c153a76e9b339d063aa29f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whitej031788/jamie-nx/git/commits/bf1eec5ecab80f1a2aa2d7839b50b89d36be4f62","verification":{"payload":"tree 8ff70593fbcbea9e06c153a76e9b339d063aa29f\nparent 5aa0c4050f801d367f7b7b4bad9d40b34a5c67fe\nauthor Craigory Coppola <craigorycoppola@gmail.com> 1746830646 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1746830646 +0000\n\nfeat(core): focus single tasks (#31159)\n\n<!-- Please make sure you have read the submission guidelines before\nposting an PR -->\n<!--\nhttps://github.com/nrwl/nx/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#-submitting-a-pr\n-->\n\n<!-- Please make sure that your commit message follows our format -->\n<!-- Example: `fix(nx): must begin with lowercase` -->\n\n<!-- If this is a particularly complex change or feature addition, you\ncan request a dedicated Nx release for this pull request branch. Mention\nsomeone from the Nx team or the `@nrwl/nx-pipelines-reviewers` and they\nwill confirm if the PR warrants its own release for testing purposes,\nand generate it for you if appropriate. -->\n\n## Current Behavior\nWhen running a single task it is automatically focused, but the tasks\nlist is visible and the task is not interactive\n\n## Expected Behavior\nWhen running a single task, the tui is minimal without a tasks list and\nwith interactivity by default\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n<!-- Please link the issue being fixed so it gets closed when this is\nmerged. -->\n\nFixes #","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoH