Behavior\nNx fails to run the task\n\n## Expected Behavior\nNx should find the project to run the task for (ignoring scope)\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n<!-- Please link the issue being fixed so it gets closed when this is\nmerged. -->\n\nFixes #","tree":{"sha":"9e9e4cf75d0fbfb716ec851ae2026c7ffa09d140","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whitej031788/jamie-nx/git/trees/9e9e4cf75d0fbfb716ec851ae2026c7ffa09d140"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whitej031788/jamie-nx/git/commits/5aa0c4050f801d367f7b7b4bad9d40b34a5c67fe","verification":{"payload":"tree 9e9e4cf75d0fbfb716ec851ae2026c7ffa09d140\nparent b620ea7dc1421f4024407ca5c5cd17672be7f1c2\nauthor Jack Hsu <jack.hsu@gmail.com> 1746830616 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1746830616 -0400\n\nfix(core): handle npm scope when matching project substring (#31160)\n\nThis PR fixes an issue if a JS project uses the same name as the npm\nscope.\n\nFor example, if you have `@acme/acme` and `@acme/acme-e2e` projects,\nthen running `nx lint acme` will fail with an error:\n\n```\n NX   Multiple projects matched:\n\n@acme/acme-e2e\n@acme/acme\n```\n## Current Behavior\nNx fails to run the task\n\n## Expected Behavior\nNx should find the project to run the task for (ignoring scope)\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n<!-- Please link the issue being fixed so it gets closed when this is\nmerged. -->\n\nFixes #","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoHoUYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFbkQAB2GT2BJSRyp8fJ3TWU79KME\nDGPaksz/LxC8AdBWPbDP3vjzQo+osUAeht5hgC97t7hXGKPR7xpH7N0vUznPgvon\n/PphBjQufmouawYL+kcOBzdGU7hAFsd3CbXEJ8FyICa8X3b8aVwdqxPwGTpto1qg\n+7jz3L55SAfwHlGbk381ZRb8nhWdt4K1LFbdjz38X/xfoMpC7sLMRA1cf2Q2FHSz\ne9axoTMezk/EOulEwuxs+s+wKb7Dj1+TvSiyT4ArRbtWpCt0V+zNCjdeWc7u5GlQ\nW9RZtNV8VmS8R/MbLwFqEQgGL2AP2KPdOJPq9ZPzB3p8o7/s9Eyxe5wsZNWYUGMX\nCNjH/B/s5uZUKwGfL45AlNvF8okCYUtr7a/6/gx2sXIiWyGoW4RzEJ1EiPg9BuMb\nt3Cs72EpG4b21kLWZmoYqmglOvNcZ9REb1Dtxm6giTD3jg65/Jv3+dDXWcgvpM2X\nmjZS++5vrtlb0DAfu/HlooQqhyGTdMV18YMLkPzVh9L0