zY3MmJlN2YxYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/whitej031788/jamie-nx/commit/f5cc2d51b0154968a74c863c0ac4cb6ba756d3b6","sha":"f5cc2d51b0154968a74c863c0ac4cb6ba756d3b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whitej031788/jamie-nx/commits/f5cc2d51b0154968a74c863c0ac4cb6ba756d3b6"}],"sha":"b620ea7dc1421f4024407ca5c5cd17672be7f1c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whitej031788/jamie-nx/commits/b620ea7dc1421f4024407ca5c5cd17672be7f1c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4332460?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cammisuli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cammisuli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cammisuli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cammisuli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Cammisuli","id":4332460,"login":"Cammisuli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMzI0NjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cammisuli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cammisuli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cammisuli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cammisuli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cammisuli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cammisuli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whitej031788/jamie-nx/commits/f5cc2d51b0154968a74c863c0ac4cb6ba756d3b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-09T19:40:07Z","email":"4332460+Cammisuli@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jonathan Cammisuli"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-09T19:40:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(core): simplify action dispatch, use mutex locking, and avoid unnecessary clones (#31157)\n\n<!-- Please make sure you have read the submission guidelines before\nposting an PR -->\n<!--\nhttps://github.com/nrwl/nx/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#-submitting-a-pr\n-->\n\n<!-- Please make sure that your commit message follows our format -->\n<!-- Example: `fix(nx): must begin with lowercase` -->\n\n<!-- If this is a particularly complex change or feature addition, you\ncan request a dedicated Nx release for this pull request branch. Mention\nsomeone from the Nx team or the `@nrwl/nx-pipelines-reviewers` and they\nwill confirm if the PR warrants its own release for testing purposes,\nand generate it for you if appropriate. -->\n\n## Current Behavior\n<!-- This is the behavior we have today -->\n* There are many unwraps that we can avoid by using `parking_lot::mutex`\n* There is an unnecessary `task::spawn` to dispatch actions. The channel\nis non-blocking and this is wasted cycles\n* There are a bunch of clones that are happening with the PtyInstances\n\n## Expected Behavior\n<!-- This is the behavior we should expect with the changes in this PR\n-->\n* Uses `parking_lot::Mutex` and removes `unwraps()`\n* Dispatches actions directly without going into tasks\n* Uses tuple derefs to avoid clones, and uses 2 instead of 4\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n<!-- Please link the issue being fixed so it gets closed when this is\nmerged. -->\n\nFixes #","tree":{"sha":"60cb62ca1140f763a47cede007575d0bec8a34ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whitej031788/jamie-nx/git/trees/60cb62ca1140f763a47cede007575d0bec8a34ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whitej031788/jamie-nx/git/commits/f5cc2d51b0154968a74c863c0ac4cb6ba756d3b6","verification":{"payload":"tree 60cb62ca1140f763a47cede007575d0bec8a34ee\nparent 8082184dc7ab2521889556a9deffc75f1be463cf\nauthor Jonathan Cammisuli <4332460+Cammisuli@users.noreply.github.com> 1746819607 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1746819607 -0400\n\nfix(core): simplify action dispatch, use mutex locking, and avoid unnecessary clones (#31157)\n\n<!-- Please make sure you have read the submission guidelines before\nposting an PR -->\n<!--\nhttps://github.com/nrwl/nx/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#-submitting-a-pr\n-->\n\n<!-- Please make sure that your commit message follows our format -->\n<!-- Example: `fix(nx): must begin with lowercase` -->\n\n<!-- If this is a particularly complex change or feature addition, you\ncan request a dedicated Nx release for this pull request branch. Mention\nsomeone from the Nx team or the `@nrwl/nx-pipelines-reviewers` and they\nwill confirm if the PR warrants its own release for testing purposes,\nand generate it for you if appropriate. -->\n\n## Current Behavior\n<!-- This is the behavior we have today -->\n* There are many unwraps that we can avoid by using `parking_lot::mutex`\n* There is an unnecessary `task::spawn` to dispatch actions. The channel\nis non-blocking and this is wasted cycles\n* There are a bunch of clones that are happening with the PtyInstances\n\n## Expected Behavior\n<!-- This is the behavior we should expect with the changes in this PR\n-->\n* Uses `parking_lot::Mutex` and removes `unwraps()`\n* Dispatches actions directly without going into tasks\n* Uses tuple derefs to avoid clones, and uses 2 instead of 4\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n<!-- Please link the issue being fixed so it gets closed when this is\nmerged. -->\n\nFixes #","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoHloXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA59oQAAFCvOTX1Agx5Nbvseuyo7R4\nlHx0ry8zY1a01J8kOXGvhZBhmLw2/hIBNWmJaw1BNgwJXJznrv5DEyKoYvLgB+lL\n5GmIkfFgGE3ea9OdFz8lHQXpw+ZtRV0Xc7hI0bXVMWqNaY1zuexjaLXsXIfw11yQ\nZ9uKEu33nmEO2rF59lQ0wNkiAsOnJK0zJ3eN1H0X7gfQi3tMkNSegUecIBxSI8KW\nvBsjJOyCIdykJjyazJ4jf0m2dXy2Qs6FCv8k0YFrkSGjxXtSJhxhZcH0X+VXJDAn\nHvUAYhnvOY9zO2n41WfJlEayrqOsm7jt/ZYIm/3pX2unaBXZO+mD+hcQ7LUbAkEN\nviKUjeU7besgLjl3VwAMvw2ZQayhnPkFp9jy6K+8dSBMgnJp52tB/kwfWojNwI5u\nAJ+OyqXYFmX6Z7SD8rIU5J1VJeJCiTxGfBuV3ldnD8qMzt4kKLoe5avtmG079hmT\nWDe3RONEJbembGpv1dTOm14pRnusqhZuNYwx3jDcCjGiNDT/u6QAZIWnXHZlx8VJ\nkkeSe4U4yt1UILKeJ1OLFi8F6ISb2voWtJ6XlYxzYaWUKch5XvlYB35D3Dm1gIBl\noJ/eRc2FRbF7kiri6h4C6+50yOY+tgd5CtTJ