ingham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndcunningham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndcunningham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndcunningham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndcunningham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndcunningham","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whitej031788/jamie-nx/commits/124eba75579c2a191172411edce2d16d1c7752f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-09T12:23:38Z","email":"ndcunningham@gmail.com","name":"Nicholas Cunningham"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-09T12:23:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(core): Update React,Vue and Node generators applications for CNW (#31059)\n\n<!-- Please make sure you have read the submission guidelines before\nposting an PR -->\n<!--\nhttps://github.com/nrwl/nx/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#-submitting-a-pr\n-->\n\n<!-- Please make sure that your commit message follows our format -->\n<!-- Example: `fix(nx): must begin with lowercase` -->\n\n<!-- If this is a particularly complex change or feature addition, you\ncan request a dedicated Nx release for this pull request branch. Mention\nsomeone from the Nx team or the `@nrwl/nx-pipelines-reviewers` and they\nwill confirm if the PR warrants its own release for testing purposes,\nand generate it for you if appropriate. -->\n\n## Current Behavior\n<!-- This is the behavior we have today -->\n- Currently, when we create a React, Vue or Node app we add the app name\ninside `package.json` under the nx\n```\n{\n  \"name\": \"@myworkspace/acme\",\n  \"version\": \"0.0.1\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"nx\": {\n    \"name\": \"acme\"\n  }\n}\n\n```\n\n- When we create a publishable library using React/JS generator inside a\nts project references workspace the `--importPath` option.\n## Expected Behavior\n<!-- This is the behavior we should expect with the changes in this PR\n-->\n- Since the original intention is not known we should not automatically\nadd this to the project''s `package.json`\n- `importPath` option should not be required when using ts project\nreferences.\n## Related Issue(s)\n<!-- Please link the issue being fixed so it gets closed when this is\nmerged. -->\nFor workspaces that are not using TS project references the result\nremains unchanged.\n\nFixes #","tree":{"sha":"3894af359ed9864fefcba7d0cccd758b10a34236","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whitej031788/jamie-nx/git/trees/3894af359ed9864fefcba7d0cccd758b10a34236"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whitej031788/jamie-nx/git/commits/124eba75579c2a191172411edce2d16d1c7752f9","verification":{"payload":"tree 3894af359ed9864fefcba7d0cccd758b10a34236\nparent 00af9748ad26247d337312d4e27e42b667560359\nauthor Nicholas Cunningham <ndcunningham@gmail.com> 1746793418 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1746793418 -0400\n\nfix(core): Update React,Vue and Node generators applications for CNW (#31059)\n\n<!-- Please make sure you have read the submission guidelines before\nposting an PR -->\n<!--\nhttps://github.com/nrwl/nx/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#-submitting-a-pr\n-->\n\n<!-- Please make sure that your commit message follows our format -->\n<!-- Example: `fix(nx): must begin with lowercase` -->\n\n<!-- If this is a particularly complex change or feature addition, you\ncan request a dedicated Nx release for this pull request branch. Mention\nsomeone from the Nx team or the `@nrwl/nx-pipelines-reviewers` and they\nwill confirm if the PR warrants its own release for testing purposes,\nand generate it for you if appropriate. -->\n\n## Current Behavior\n<!-- This is the behavior we have today -->\n- Currently, when we create a React, Vue or Node app we add the app name\ninside `package.json` under the nx\n```\n{\n  \"name\": \"@myworkspace/acme\",\n  \"version\": \"0.0.1\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"nx\": {\n    \"name\": \"acme\"\n  }\n}\n\n```\n\n- When we create a publishable library using React/JS generator inside a\nts project references workspace the `--importPath` option.\n## Expected Behavior\n<!-- This is the behavior we should expect with the changes in this PR\n-->\n- Since the original intention is not known we should not automatically\nadd this to the project''s `package.json`\n- `importPath` option should not be required when using ts project\nreferences.\n## Related Issue(s)\n<!-- Please link the issue being fixed so it gets closed when this is\nmerged. -->\nFor workspaces that are not using TS project references the result\nremains unchanged.\n\nFixes #","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoHfPKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkXIQAFcOH4uA9wr4dwbPQq04Q9m8\ndvWa5zpMs02DEu8Y8avCfFaJFXz+R4YX/ND9f6x9pF5AmBPrLgXSaeYmHXFqoXGW\n2k+JEDvDUjcP6LRmt0faKqifjG25vV4YAqpE5fkrTDIQmSIjo5g/NheoFTPsm2Oy\nhnKgXcXPijtVRh1lb2WIICZOdZVXa3ikEi5CL2k/N+TWAotdp3k/HaUENFnbbHER\nfiSaG7gy1UROg7ckx7LwBvwVLH6mIqVHK3T14dbS04JZGSLMev2VU1rwV0iRrlbt\n/Xf86Km9GqfAsCEXWdhSpN2l2hn3KMNjIhu4BsauSJfxZIrEsHN/E8AN+vF07bnp\nbuFCLOXvpfkWCVnd8g+yvnWLseKls562ASIgfd15bzLua50FI/eHYTEM2pGwHykE\n9StG9UCQ1DA5ADLQYam/gtKi8JzYBmU7drVZEI0jHk5lnrcDHsOCwxpzJ+Ux/oPo\nKOQc2ZfTi7WXBlEAH2H8WjdtDM9viHF2CaynZMZMCK9duNUquGE0ZiDQm+yNPKsj\nYZz3PRhr3DmHuMcotehk8JxE/pr/n6h4cn+wm5wjsnKx5/o7fnJk0k7i14wgd3pq\nDKSmJVyTXNo2YKJyCQB8vxmecIdxqOBiFecssknvYmiqPOCMmprr5nJL6Jpb3ocj\nQvWlaRzsDhVHWsG710dN\n=ZQVF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-05-16T19:40:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","i